#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0018 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "D10 (PLAN-library-template-label-resolution), on OUR metadata store: under a run that declares only ADaMIG 1.1, ADAE resolves against the inferred OCCDS 1.0 and every label here equals the published one -> silent. The positive twin of -invalid_adae_inferred_occds."
#library-ref standard=adamig version=1-1
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AETERM type=Char label="Reported Term for the Adverse Event"
col AEDECOD type=Char label="Dictionary-Derived Term"
col ADURN type=Num label="Analysis Duration (N)"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | HEADACHE | 3
